Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO! YAMOO! YAMOO! YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.45,0:01:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, isn't he cute when he's thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is teaching me how\Nto play duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Drooling monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel monsters, you nimrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been at it for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's starting to get the hang of\Nthe game, but Yugi's like an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,See, each card has an attack\Nnumber and a defense number.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.77,0:01:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First player to eliminate their\Nopponent's life points wins the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good move, huh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, pretty good move,\Nbut not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A card that powerful totally wipes me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you stink at this game, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You did fine, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have better cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:02:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,See, my grandpa owns a game shop,\Nand I get all my best cards from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your own game shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can even get my grandpa to\Nshow us this super rare card he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Could they have found the card\Nthat I've been searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see you've brought company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps, could you show my friends\Nyour awesome super rare card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My special card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You kids are in for a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't take this card out too often.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Blue Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So rare, so powerful, I\Nnever let it leave my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look all that special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this card is priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only four of\Nthem in all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.33,0:02:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of priceless, I'm ready to trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant show me some other\Ncool cards to get me started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.03,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't, it certainly\Nwouldn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba! Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he have a big\Nfancy company to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it's any of your business,\Nbut I came to see the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you into Duel Monsters 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could all duel together sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Duel you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have more of a\Nchallenge playing solitaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the number one ranked\Nduelist in the country and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the favorite to win the\NDuel Monsters Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't last two\Nminutes in a duel against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.27,0:03:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd like to settle this\Nwith fists instead of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Yugi, Kaiba's asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, does this shop have\Nany worthwhile cards or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can it be the Blue-Eyes\NWhite Dragon in a dump like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the card I've been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, enough window shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else\NI can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your Blue-Eyes White Dragon\Ncard and I'll trade you all of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't trade, maybe you'll sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Name your price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pay anything you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But this card is worth more to\Nme than you could ever offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not because of its power,\Nor because it's so rare,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but because of what it means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This card was given to\Nme by a dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And so I treasure this\Ncard as I do that friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So parting with it is\Ncompletely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd feel the same even if it\Nwere a common card, right, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, this precious card\Nhas bonded with my heart. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Senile old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard in the cards. Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,These cards are all about power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And one way or another, his Blue\NEyes White Dragon card will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a little something I'd like\Nyou to pick up for me at the game shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly, Master Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My master Seto Kaiba\Nchallenges you to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You will come with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I were to decline?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I must insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Kaiba doesn't understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll teach him a lesson\Nabout the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I hope he has some cool cards today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Gramps, we're\Nback to get more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but why would he\Nleave the door unlocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Game shop? Ah, Yugi. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather's here visiting,\Nbut he's not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come by my\Noffice and pick him up? Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi, I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to teach that boy Kaiba a lesson\Nabout the heart of the cards, but I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.01,0:07:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the old man feeling,\Nhmm? Kaiba! You sleaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a duel, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,With each of us putting up our\Nmost valuable card as the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess playing against\Na champion like myself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,was just too much\Nstimulation for the old fool
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba you should be ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fair and look at the sweet prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's most treasured card. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the blue-eyes white dragon\Nis a rare and powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,card and this one will\Nnever be used against me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue-eyes white dragon my treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this. Huh? Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I built this deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I put my soul in these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I taught you everything\NI know, Yugi. Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my cards and teach him respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach Kaiba respect for the\Nheart of the cards, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But Grandpa, you need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get you to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends can care\Nfor your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,While you and I duel, unless\Nyou're afraid. Take him, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We could take care of your grandpa\Nwhile you take care of creepy Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach that rich spoiled brat\Nwhat a real duel's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,For your grandpa, Yugi. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you're like the best player I've ever\Nseen and you've got the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Grandpa, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you will, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, put your hands together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll mark us with a special sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a symbol of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:09:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Yugi's dueling, no matter how tough\Nit gets, he'll know that he's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all right there with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, Tristan and I will take\NYugi's grandpa to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get back in\Nthere and cheer Yugi on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, take good care of him, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I designed this virtual stadium myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It adds a bit more life to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We each begin with 2,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,First player to hit zero loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to play, Runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Playtime is over, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.57,0:10:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaiba, prepare yourself,\Nbecause it's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtual system's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I attack with the mighty Hitatsumi giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never dueled like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This brought the monster\Non the card to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my virtual simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It creates lifelike holograms\Nof every duel monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how you beat my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I call on the winged dragon,\Nguardian of the fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Real monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireball attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:11:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well played, Yugi, for a beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will you deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Soggy the Dark Clown, but that card\Nhas hardly any attack strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,True, your Winged Dragon's attack is\N1,400, while my Dark Clown's is only 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I combine it with this card...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Negative Energy Generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It multiplies my\Nmonster's attack by three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Clown, attack with Dark Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, combining\Ncards can be very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows every aspect of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But my grandpa put all\Nhis gaming knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,his whole heart, into\Nassembling this deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to believe that it\Nholds some secret strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't beat the Dark Clown with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to use a different monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster will be sacrificed, but\Nmy overall life points will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Light Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not faring any better\Nthan the old man did, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deck is just as weak and\Nfeeble as your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa is a great man and a\Nbetter duelist than you'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He entrusted me with his cards, and\NI can feel his heart in this deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt you have that kind of\Nfaith in your cards, Kaiba. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But I believe in my grandpa's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And my faith rewards me with\NGaia, the Fierce Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,with a destructive power of 2300.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kaiba, your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, this'll be over sooner than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I call on the blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We all watch Kaiba tear that card in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think your grandfather was the only\None to possess a blue-eyes white dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, your fierce knight is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Faith or no faith, you will fall\Nbefore my superior monsters, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Power is what this game\Nis all about, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Faith is for losers, like\Nyour pathetic grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In your entire deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,there's not a single card that can\Nstand up to a blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So what hope do you have against two?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just admit defeat, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.81,0:14:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords of Revealing Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It stops all monsters on\Nthe field for three turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What possible good will a\Nthree-turn delay do? He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out what\Nto do with these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just a bunch of pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I use them to\Nbattle an expert like Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone claiming to have faith,\Nyou're giving up too easily, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, sometimes the\Ncards are like a puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to put all the different\Npieces in their proper place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, like the Millennium Puzzle? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Each piece helps build a greater entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the pieces of a\Npuzzle, Yugi. Remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.34,0:15:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When are the cards like a puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Grandpa once said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dual Monsters contains only one\Nunstoppable monster, Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But he can only be summoned by\Ndrawing all five special cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A feat that to this very day\Nno one has ever accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your stalling, Yu-Gi, or\Nyou will forfeit the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I never forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.23,0:15:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Another piece of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.97,0:15:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw any card you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragons may be frozen\Nfor another two turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but my new monster is under no such spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Judge Man, with an\Nattack power of 2,200.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can attack with the Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but he won't stand a chance once\NKaiba's dragons are free of my spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Judge Man falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a sacrifice that doesn't even faze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And though neither dragon can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For one more turn, my next card is\Nthe third Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:17:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, Yugi, how's your faith now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,On my next turn, all three Blue-Eyes\NWhite Dragons are free to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This game's over no\Nmatter what card you draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't possibly stand against my three\Nblue eyes white dragons it's over yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you were never a match for me don't\Nlisten yuki kaiba had three blue eyes all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,along he only wanted grandpa's card so\Nit couldn't be used against him my only
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,chance now is to assemble all the pieces\Nof exodia but The odds are against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The deck, it senses my doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose focus, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.05,0:17:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friendship symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we're right here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you've got to believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kick Kaiba's butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to believe in the cards\Nlike my friends believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw your last pathetic card\Nso I can end this, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.95,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa's deck has no\Npathetic cards, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But it does contain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the unstoppable Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've assembled all five special cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All five pieces of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, it's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever been able to call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother never loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You play only for power, Kaiba,\Nand that is why you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you put your heart in the\Ngame, there is nothing you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But... but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have lost to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, if you truly want\Nto know, open your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you will begin to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's awake. Yugi won.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.39,0:19:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, sir Seto Kaiba, our uncontested\Nchampion He's been defeated in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,sir By someone named Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
